PACKAGE NAME:     ntb-djc
PACKAGE SIZE:     83 K
PACKAGE LOCATION: diskt6
PACKAGE DESCRIPTION:
ntb-djc:  ntb-djc 0.1
ntb-djc:
ntb-djc:  These are the binaries for the dvi driver for the HP Deskjet 500, 
ntb-djc:  500c and 550c. They do not use the kpathsea library, and expect the
ntb-djc:  pk files for the Deskjet in the directory /usr/lib/texmf/pk and the
ntb-djc:  tfm files in /usr/lib/texmf/tfm. Therefore, if you want to use this
ntb-djc:  drivers you have to copy the pk and tfm files in these directories or
ntb-djc:  make symbolic links from these directories to the pk and tfm files.
ntb-djc:
FILE LIST:
./
usr/
usr/bin/
usr/bin/dvi500
usr/bin/dvi500c
usr/bin/dvi550c
